<title>MEXICO: FEMSA 1997 Q1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>FEMSA 1997 Q1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		  293.48 million	     554.88 million</p>
<p>     Revs		 4.995 bln		4.699 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     2.117 bln		1.814 bln</p>
<p>     Oper profit	484.72 million	     286.50 million</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain   30.59 million		402.82 million</p>
<p>	    Int paid    214.38 million	     237.21 million</p>
<p>	    FX loss     47.71 million	gain  124.99 million</p>
<p>	    Int earned  53.20 million		97.98 million</p>
<p>	    Mon gain    239.48 million     gain  417.06 million</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Fomento Economico Mexicano SA</p>
<p>de CV.</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
